{"time": 1753759623, "type": "recv", "message_id": "93216957", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "名取雅"}, "message": "“早上好，诺特先生”"}
{"time": 1753759639, "type": "recv", "message_id": "847451036", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“早。有什么事情吗？”"}
{"time": 1753759645, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1034381111", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "“大老远把我们叫来，是有什么事”"}
{"time": 1753759647, "type": "recv", "message_id": "654796877", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "他先是看向许司昤，点点头微笑回应“早上好许小姐”"}
{"time": 1753759695, "type": "recv", "message_id": "979832219", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "246376731"}, "sender": {"id": "246376731", "name": "ㅤᅠㅤㅤᅠㅤㅤᅠㅤᅠ"}, "message": "（乐"}
{"time": 1753759713, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1802619460", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "（笑死"}
{"time": 1753759718, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1349305506", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "“早上好诺特先生”"}
{"time": 1753759718, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1624719017", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "*靠墙站"}
{"time": 1753759750, "type": "recv", "message_id": "511057528", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "而后便回应苏理绘“苏小姐是吗，早上好”又看向椎名绪“你好……”"}
{"time": 1753759783, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1375173701", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "“工作有些忙还请见谅，各位好，我是你们本次委托的雇主，史蒂芬·诺特，一位房产商人”"}
{"time": 1753759842, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2004913208", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "＊点了点头，从衣服里拿出笔和本子靠在墙边"}
{"time": 1753759862, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1056343430", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "“相信你们或多或少都了解了一些本次委托的目标，我为各位准备了大概的材料，请各自看看吧”，说着，他从桌上杂乱的文件堆中翻找了一会，拿出了几份文件，放在桌上示意你们请取去看。"}
{"time": 1753759876, "type": "recv", "message_id": "779622089", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "*拿"}
{"time": 1753759901, "type": "recv", "message_id": "701675511", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "“卖不出去的房子？”"}
{"time": 1753759924, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2044348751", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "名取雅"}, "message": "*缓步上前，拿起文件“很荣幸接到您的委托，希望我们能帮到您”"}
{"time": 1753759926, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1766957136", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "文件大概介绍了一座位于波士顿市中心的老房子，前租户马卡里奥一家在搬进去后便悲剧连连。自事情发生以后，这间房子就一直租不出去，诺特先生想要卖掉也没人愿意接手，因此他委托你们调查清楚这间房子到底发生了什么，并且解决可能存在的问题、为他的房子证明清白。为此他愿意补偿你们在这件事上花费的时间和精力。\n文件的背面提到了关于这座房子的过去可能能获得资料的地点：波士顿环球报社地下的报刊资料室，中心图书馆以及档案馆。"}
{"time": 1753759927, "type": "recv", "message_id": "887396517", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "＊接过文件仔细翻看"}
{"time": 1753760000, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1495709499", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "“有意思”"}
{"time": 1753760156, "type": "recv", "message_id": "522762451", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "诺特注意到椎名绪看完，便皱着眉头苦笑道“椎名先生，请你来也是因为您的身份，希望您能帮忙为我的房子证明清白之后再刊登在报纸上……若能顺利完成委托，必有重谢！”"}
{"time": 1753760239, "type": "recv", "message_id": "318103397", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "（我们知道老房子地址吗）"}
{"time": 1753760245, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1306896529", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "（知道的）"}
{"time": 1753760247, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2144549638", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=522762451]“也就是说，我们要帮你证明房子的清白，然后我也可以得到新闻报道么……”思考了一下，“那么合作愉快吧诺特先生”"}
{"time": 1753760250, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1045052856", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "（我打字好慢）"}
{"time": 1753760339, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1679655453", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "“那我呢诺特先生，您的房子卖不出去，需要我一个设计师做什么？重新设计一翻？”"}
{"time": 1753760351, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1319046055", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "诺特先生又看向剩下二人“当然许小姐，因为我现在实在忙的没法脱身才会来委托你和苏小姐，我承诺要是你们能解决这件事，许小姐你在大学期间的所有房租我都会为您免除，同时再给予一笔额外的报酬”"}
{"time": 1753760394, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1884183107", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=B8168A843215222D7988FCC4A3714DC0.png,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhR5b5VucRkub72-wNqo81forIue_BjOOiD_CiisrMvKkuGOAzIEcHJvZFCAvaMBWhD06_wiCQAe2jcWR8hGar3megKLfQ&amp;rkey=CAESMFoyS5uE4PyHRZzWA-CpWkJp0bGiXhDJhzQ9jKk5fGHTr1m_WF6v1nZzatXtmwZvVw,file_size=7502]"}
{"time": 1753760525, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1013307684", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "诺特又有些迟疑地看向苏理绘“其实……这份委托发给了许多人，只是除你和许小姐、椎名先生之外，好像并没有其他人来到我的办公室外……”"}
{"time": 1753760534, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2108360118", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "名取雅"}, "message": "*微笑看向诺特先生 “自我来到这里上学以来，颇受您的照顾，见你这段时间心中烦闷，甚是担心，希望我能帮您解决问题，同时也感谢您对我的信任”"}
{"time": 1753760580, "type": "recv", "message_id": "697572844", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "诺特低声叹气“毕竟那座房子，可能……用你们中国人的话说，真有点……邪、门？”"}
{"time": 1753760626, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2004426842", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "*被勾起好奇心“邪门？”"}
{"time": 1753760667, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1082653720", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2108360118][CQ:at,qq=3166982250] 诺特感激地看向你"}
{"time": 1753760714, "type": "recv", "message_id": "415590355", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "“邪门吗……我撰写的稿子里也有一些灵异事件，或许我能知道些什么”＊转着手里的钢笔微笑着看诺特先生"}
{"time": 1753760721, "type": "recv", "message_id": "809298228", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "“我可是第一次听人亲口说出这个词，平常都在悬疑小说里看到”"}
{"time": 1753760780, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1136182563", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "“呃……涉及到租户个人信息与一些似真似假的传闻，我不太好过多评论……还是请你们自己去调查，用自己的眼睛得到结果吧……”"}
{"time": 1753760793, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1731822721", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "名取雅"}, "message": "*听到诺特先生的话，感到有些紧张，看向椎名先生和苏小姐 “这世间哪有鬼怪作乱的都是人罢了。大家接下这份委托都是希望帮诺特先生解决问题的，那我们大家一起努力吧。” 观察大家的反应，微笑“可以获得资料的地点有三个，你们是想分开去收集线索，还是想大家一起呢？”"}
{"time": 1753760851, "type": "recv", "message_id": "61937529", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "名取雅"}, "message": "（文件的背面提到了关于这座房子的过去可能能获得资料的地点：波士顿环球报社地下的报刊资料室，中心图书馆以及档案馆。）"}
